Package: ominull-agent
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libcurl4 | libcurl3, openssl, iptables
Maintainer: Ominull Project <secops@example.invalid>
Description: Ominull Linux network telemetry and threat nullification agent
 The daemon collects bounded network flow telemetry and applies authenticated
 isolation state returned by the Ominull hub.
